{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22118","headline":"养拙 · 白居易","name":"养拙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铁柔不爲劒，木曲不爲辕。\n今我亦如此，愚蒙不及门。\n甘心谢名利，灭迹归丘园。\n坐卧茅茨中，但对琴与尊。\n身去缰锁累，耳辞朝市喧。\n逍遥无所爲，时窥五千言。\n无忧乐性场，寡欲清心源。\n始知不才者，可以探道根。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}